ve.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;h=
3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                      =
                          &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                      =
              1.Prepare your printer:=0A                                   =
             &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                               =
 &lt;p&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer to=0A                 =
                                   unpack the printer, install ink or toner=
, and add paper.=0A                                                    Turn=
 on the printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A               =
                                     any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                 =
                               &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                 =
                   2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A=
                                                    came with the printer t=
o connect it to the network.=0A                                            =
    &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A  =
                                                  If you have a Wi-Fi print=
er, you might need to connect=0A                                           =
         the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A       =
