 printer to your Mac,=0A                                                   =
 install the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A                =
                                    use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assista=
nt to connect the printer=0A                                               =
     to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A                   =
                                 disconnect the cable from your printer and=
 Mac and the=0A                                                    printer =
should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                           =
                     &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                            =
    &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. Add t=
he printer to your list of available printers:=0A                          =
                      &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                      =
          &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    Choose =
Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                       =
