t, select your=0A                                                    printe=
r, then click Add.=0A                                                &lt;/stro=
ng&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It may take=
 a minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                            =
                        If you see a message prompting you to download new=
=0A                                                    software, make sure =
to download and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                   =
